  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Shaikh Saddam Shaikh Mehabub vs The State Of Maharashtra on 28 May, 2024 911-ABA-873-2024.odt In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Bench At Aurangabad Anticipatory Bail Application No. 873 Of 2024 Shaikh Saddam Shaikh Mehabub Versus The State Of Maharashtra ... Mr. S. S. Chapalgaonkar, Advocate for Applicant With Anticipatory Bail Application No. 874 Of 2024 Ashpak Mehabub Shaikh And Another Versus The State Of Maharashtra ... Mr. A. N. Barhate Patil, Advocate for Applicants Mrs. C. C. Kutti, App for Respondents/State ...",
    "facts": "These are applications for anticipatory bail in respect of C.R. No. 128/2024 registered with Waluj Police Station, Tq. Gangapur, Dist. Aurangabad for offence punishable under Sections 272, 273, 328, 188 read with Section 34 of the Indian Penal Code and Section 59 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. It is alleged Shaikh Saddam Shaikh Mehabub vs The State Of Maharashtra on 28 May, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/62586968/ 1 Page 1 of 3 911-ABA-873-2024.odt that applicant/Shaikh Saddam Shaikh Mehbub is the owner of contraband apprehended by the raiding party. Names of applicants - Ashfaq and Mohsin Mehbub are not seen in the FIR. 3. Considering the nature of the allegations, I find it appropriate to extend pre-arrest protection to the applicants.",
